{
  "title": "Add Status Filter to List/Tree Commands",
  "status": "closed",
  "prompt": "Extend all list and tree commands with a filter for status. Support both --open and --status open syntax. Different meanings: bundles shows bundles where at least one ticket/todo is open, tickets filters by status. Also extend goals to have a bundle field.",
